WEBVTT

00:02:58.983 --> 00:03:01.976
between a Feynman sandwich
and a Susskind sandwich."

00:03:02.491 --> 00:03:04.506
And without skipping a beat at all,

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:07.772
he said, "Well, they'd be about the same.

00:03:07.796 --> 00:03:11.118
The only difference is a Susskind
sandwich would have a lot more ham."

00:03:11.142 --> 00:03:12.827
"Ham" as in bad actor.

00:03:12.851 --> 00:03:14.375
(Laughter)

00:03:14.399 --> 00:03:17.809
Well, I happened to have been
very quick that day,

00:03:17.833 --> 00:03:19.976
and I said, "Yeah,
but a lot less baloney."

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.954
(Laughter)

00:03:22.978 --> 00:03:24.115
(Applause)

00:03:24.139 --> 00:03:27.321
The truth of the matter

00:03:27.345 --> 00:03:31.327
is that a Feynman sandwich
had a load of ham,